Output docs/vhs/out/02-send-get-and-post-json.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Hide
Type "export SENDITO_KEYCHAIN=memory && cd /tmp/sendito-demo && clear" Enter
Show
Type "sendito" Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "/list" Enter Enter Sleep 800ms F5 Sleep 1500ms
Type "/create" Enter Enter Sleep 500ms Alt+3 Enter Down Ctrl+A Type `{"name": "Zé"}` F5 Sleep 1500ms
Ctrl+W Type "j" Alt+4 Sleep 1500ms
Ctrl+Q
